        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabine_Pass"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1941, the U.S. authorized a coastal artillery emplacement and Harbor Entrance Control Post at Sabine Pass in response to Operation Drumbeat.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sabine_Pass"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The natural opening between Sabine Lake and the Gulf of Mexico separates Jefferson County, Texas, and Calcasieu Parish, Louisiana.",
